{"unit_id":"MJorgin__dsh-skill-router#card-zh","repo":"MJorgin/dsh-skill-router","commit":"0ceeb96d882bafc3aaeea6e4ce31396e1c2489e8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-router 是一个用于 DSH 的技能自动路由插件，在 agent/pre-step 阶段读取待处理的用户消息，并按 YAML 策略或技能的 whenToUse 短语匹配技能。命中后，它通过 DSH skills 服务读取可调用技能，将技能内容加入当前步骤；没有命中时保持原有流程，每个技能在同一会话中最多注入一次。策略支持用户配置，解析失败时回退到内置规则。适合希望按任务关键词、文档链接或短语自动载入已安装技能的 DSH 用户。无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:39-92","policy.js:47-78"]}
{"unit_id":"MJorgin__dsh-skill-router#card-en","repo":"MJorgin/dsh-skill-router","commit":"0ceeb96d882bafc3aaeea6e4ce31396e1c2489e8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-skill-router loads installed DSH skills before a step using editable YAML rules and skill trigger phrases. Matches add an invocable skill once per session; misses preserve normal handling. Invalid policies use bundled defaults. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:39-92","policy.js:47-78"]}
