{"unit_id":"MJorgin__dsh-skill-router#feature-1","repo":"MJorgin/dsh-skill-router","commit":"0ceeb96d882bafc3aaeea6e4ce31396e1c2489e8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-router 的功能「按策略路由技能」：在步骤前读取用户文本，按首个匹配规则选择技能。用户可在 DSH_HOME 下配置 skill-router.yaml。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:44-71","policy.js:34-45"]}
{"unit_id":"MJorgin__dsh-skill-router#feature-2","repo":"MJorgin/dsh-skill-router","commit":"0ceeb96d882bafc3aaeea6e4ce31396e1c2489e8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-router 的功能「将匹配技能加入步骤」：规则命中后通过 skills 服务获取技能内容，并作为 skill-invocation 消息追加到当前步骤；不可调用或不存在的技能会被略过。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:77-92"]}
{"unit_id":"MJorgin__dsh-skill-router#feature-3","repo":"MJorgin/dsh-skill-router","commit":"0ceeb96d882bafc3aaeea6e4ce31396e1c2489e8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-router 的功能「使用技能触发短语」：它把安装技能摘要中长度不超过 80 个字符的 whenToUse 值作为字面触发条件，追加到 YAML 规则后参与匹配。","source":"generated","evidence":["policy.js:47-60","index.js:64-67"]}
{"unit_id":"MJorgin__dsh-skill-router#feature-4","repo":"MJorgin/dsh-skill-router","commit":"0ceeb96d882bafc3aaeea6e4ce31396e1c2489e8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-router 的功能「每会话去重」：技能名会记录在会话对应的集合中，已注入过的技能在本会话后续匹配时跳过，避免重复追加相同内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:22-23","index.js:77-89"]}
{"unit_id":"MJorgin__dsh-skill-router#feature-5","repo":"MJorgin/dsh-skill-router","commit":"0ceeb96d882bafc3aaeea6e4ce31396e1c2489e8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-router 的功能「无命中时静默放行」：没有规则命中，或没有可注入的新技能时，返回原有决策，不向当前步骤追加消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:73-75","index.js:88-90"]}
